<title>FINLAND: Rauma Q1 profit falls 24 pct.</title>
<headline>Rauma Q1 profit falls 24 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31-</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit before extras and tax		   158 vs 208</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		   2.07 vs 2.81</p>
<p> Net sales					  2,315 vs 2,449</p>
<p> Operating profit				   165 vs 216</p>
<p>NOTE - Eleven analysts' median forecast for Finnish engineering group Rauma Oy had been 155 million markka profit (range 131-260 million).  </p>
<p> Gross profit					 670 vs 752</p>
<p> Other income and expenses, net		  20 vs 25</p>
<p> Share in results of associated companies     1 vs 0</p>
<p> Net interest and other fin. expenses  charge 8 vs 8 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items				  0 vs 0</p>
<p> Profit before minorities, taxes		158 vs 208</p>
<p> Taxes						   46 vs 58</p>
<p> Minority interests				   0 vs 2</p>
<p> Net profit					   112 vs 152</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    44.4 vs 42.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish engineering group is Rauma Oy.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0235</p>
